    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0597",
      "reading_order": 761,
      "section": "Operations communication:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.991000000000014,
        "t": 701.22601953125,
        "r": 558.8910000000001,
        "b": 680.8983344167461
      },
      "content": "The oven has two main controlling parts, being the User Interface 'UI' assembly (keyboard, screen, logic) and the Inputs & Outputs 'IO' Board (to switch and monitor the required operation).",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_760",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_5",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_5",
          "title": "5 Service information"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_760",
          "title": "Operations communication:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 49,
      "chunk_hint": "section_start",
      "semantic_role": "overview",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0598",
      "reading_order": 762,
      "section": "Operations communication:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.999999999999886,
        "t": 676.98901953125,
        "r": 558.855,
        "b": 656.6613344167462
      },
      "content": "The UI is the master of the oven and instructs the IO what to do, in turn the IO communicates information on the operation back to the UI.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_760",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_5",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_5",
          "title": "5 Service information"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_760",
          "title": "Operations communication:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 49,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0599",
      "reading_order": 763,
      "section": "Operations communication:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.95499999999994,
        "t": 652.3920195312501,
        "r": 558.7289999999999,
        "b": 632.0643344167462
      },
      "content": "The UI and IO have their own Personality Module (PM) fitted with the respective software to be able to communicate and work with each other.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_760",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_5",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_5",
          "title": "5 Service information"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_760",
          "title": "Operations communication:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 49,
      "chunk_hint": "continue",
      "semantic_role": "description",
      "source": "pdf_text"
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0600",
      "reading_order": 764,
      "section": "Operations communication:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.9549999999999,
        "t": 627.91201953125,
        "r": 558.8639999999998,
        "b": 607.5843344167462
      },
      "content": "The power provision to the UI and the communication between UI and IO is enabled via ONE cable with a multipin (12 pin X523) connector fitted.",
      "section_id": "sec_auto_760",
      "parent_section_id": "sec_5",
      "section_level": 2,
      "section_path": [
        {
          "id": "sec_5",
          "title": "5 Service information"
        },
        {
          "id": "sec_auto_760",
          "title": "Operations communication:"
        }
      ],
      "page": 49,
